(text "FIELD 24V -> 5V / 100mA - STANDALONE REVIEW CIRCUIT r0.1" (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c53c9722-7ab8-5601-b9e5-73e20cf7c37a"))
(text "All returns are FIELD_GND. This buck is NOT an isolation barrier. No LOGIC_GND connection.\n18-30V local-input study; entry chain currently proposes 19-30V. Negative input / retained-output backfeed NOT qualified." (at 20.32 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ca313b91-5f37-536d-b377-2d0b40ade929"))
(text "Input effective capacitance >=4.7uF is a qualification gate, not proved by nominal sum. C1-C5 close to VIN/GND.\nU1 RT tied to internal VCC selects 1MHz. VCC powers no external load; C6 connects BOOT to SW, never ground." (at 20.32 49 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "39d9d660-807b-53f6-9d27-f24fa8e3b346"))
(text "STARTUP: R1/R2 bias F_PGOOD from protected input.\nEntry TPS26630 PGOOD sinks this node until ready.\nREMOVE entry R29; no parallel 5V pull-up or DNP path.\nJ1.3 is an analog power-enable node, not GPIO." (at 20.32 220 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "041e8f59-d8b5-5912-bccf-d959069aacfd"))
(text "PGOOD below valid VIN is UNKNOWN.\nFIELD_5V_PGOOD is diagnostic only.\nR4 is a weak bleed; no rapid discharge guarantee." (at 395 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c188e53d-87c5-5723-a408-9ebdc536d6fe"))
(text "Release blockers: input/output capacitor derating; fixed-5V PFM accuracy; custom U1/L1 footprints; entry integration; load/inrush; EMC; layout/thermal/bench tests.\nField output loads MUST remain held off through entry ramp and rail startup; driver/inhibit circuit still required. This supply grants no machine permission.\nBoundary connectors are schematic interfaces only. No PCB, DRC, Gerbers, assembly placement, isolation rating or physical qualification is claimed." (at 20.32 362 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5202367f-4040-5fa8-819f-e202d88361a4"))
)
